    {
      "key": "Legacy.d2ed5ba951c09bf7",
      "zh-Hans": "行旅钱\n背包和仓库中的行旅钱均可用于局内行商。\n每个分解固定返还2500金币。",
      "en": "Travel Coins\nTravel Coins in the backpack and warehouse can both be spent at route merchants.\nDismantling each returns exactly 2500 Gold."
    },
    {
      "key": "Legacy.0466c38796599593",
      "zh-Hans": "行走江湖，兜里有钱。\n背包和仓库中的行旅钱均可用于局内行商。\n普通宝箱材料池可开出10个，局外商店100000金币购入10个。\n分解每个固定返还2500金币。",
      "en": "Keep some coin for the road.\nTravel Coins in the backpack and warehouse can both be spent at route merchants.\nNormal Chest material rewards can contain 10; the meta shop sells 10 for 100000 Gold.\nDismantling each returns exactly 2500 Gold."
    },
